{"4665270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cosmic Crumbs: Bakery Simulator", "steam_appid": 4665270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4962420], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚀 <strong>Cosmic Crumbs: Bakery Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run your own bakery… in space.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bake sweet treats, prepare coffee, keep your shelves stocked, and stay on top of a growing stream of customer orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your bakery gets busier, organize your workflow, put your robot helpers to work, and keep everything running smoothly — alone or with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665270/extras/10ca5059c23d9ec08ee3f1b185c1ab77.poster.avif?t=1788289679\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665270/extras/10ca5059c23d9ec08ee3f1b185c1ab77.webm?t=1788289679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665270/extras/10ca5059c23d9ec08ee3f1b185c1ab77.mp4?t=1788289679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🍩 BAKE &amp; BREW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your machines to prepare desserts and fresh coffee for your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep production moving, prepare what you need ahead of time, and make sure you’re ready when new orders arrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665270/extras/9551580df401464727278487679c498c.poster.avif?t=1788289679\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665270/extras/9551580df401464727278487679c498c.webm?t=1788289679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665270/extras/9551580df401464727278487679c498c.mp4?t=1788289679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🍰 STOCK, SERVE &amp; KEEP UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A prepared bakery is a successful bakery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your display stocked, respond to incoming orders, and serve customers before things start piling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the bakery gets busier, balancing preparation and speed becomes increasingly important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665270/extras/15331e06d64c81750dd4b683783a1bab.poster.avif?t=1788289679\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665270/extras/15331e06d64c81750dd4b683783a1bab.webm?t=1788289679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665270/extras/15331e06d64c81750dd4b683783a1bab.mp4?t=1788289679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤖 PUT YOUR ROBOTS TO WORK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t have to run the bakery alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different robot helpers to support your daily workflow and take some of the pressure off as your business grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide where their help matters most and keep your bakery operating efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665270/extras/7c3646b73128dfbdcd1e5816d874711f.poster.avif?t=1788289679\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665270/extras/7c3646b73128dfbdcd1e5816d874711f.webm?t=1788289679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665270/extras/7c3646b73128dfbdcd1e5816d874711f.mp4?t=1788289679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🪐 BUILD A BAKERY OF YOUR OWN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your small space bakery into a place that feels like yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your setup, unlock new possibilities, and customize your bakery with decorations as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665270/extras/d2c1739a2d9c98ab1f4c722238001c1d.poster.avif?t=1788289679\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665270/extras/d2c1739a2d9c98ab1f4c722238001c1d.webm?t=1788289679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665270/extras/d2c1739a2d9c98ab1f4c722238001c1d.mp4?t=1788289679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⏱️ MANAGE THE RUSH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orders won’t wait forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan ahead, manage your stock, organize production, and adapt when the bakery gets hectic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better prepared you are, the easier it is to handle the next rush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665270/extras/b0feefa6ecc00e0dfc198d23a5e263d8.poster.avif?t=1788289679\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665270/extras/b0feefa6ecc00e0dfc19